      hu: "A Velebit a horvát tengerpart mentén húzódó nagy hegység, és a vad hegyvidéki tájak erős jelképe. A vonulat látványosan köti össze a tengeri panorámát, a karsztot és a védett területeket. A túrázók panorámaútvonalak, aktív turizmus és komoly túrák miatt keresik. SEO-ban nagyon erős, mert a hegy, a part és a horvát outdoor témák gyakran együtt jelennek meg.",
      ro: "Velebit este marele lanț muntos de-a lungul coastei croate și un simbol puternic al peisajelor montane sălbatice. Masivul leagă spectaculos marea, carstul și zonele protejate. Drumeții îl caută pentru trasee panoramice, turism activ și ture solicitante. SEO-ul este foarte puternic deoarece munte, coastă și outdoor croat sunt căutate împreună.",
      en: "Velebit is the major mountain range along the Croatian coast and a strong symbol of wild mountain scenery. The range connects sea views, karst, and protected areas in a striking way. Hikers search for Velebit for panoramic trails, outdoor tourism, and demanding routes. It is very strong for SEO because mountain, coast, and Croatian outdoor terms are often searched together."
